<title>ITALY: RAS SpA H1 96 net profits rise slightly.</title>
<headline>RAS SpA H1 96 net profits rise slightly.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30.</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>Parent company results</p>
<p>    Net profit		     157    vs    154</p>
<p>    Premium income	     1,993    vs  1,737</p>
<p>    Life premiums		  477    vs    435</p>
<p>    Non-life premiums	  1,259    vs  1,226</p>
<p>NOTE - Italian insurer RAS SpA, controlled by German insurer Allianz, said it expected its results for the whole of 1996 to be satisfactory and to be not dissimilar to those reported in 1995.  </p>
<p>    Pretax profit		  333    vs   336</p>
<p>    Tax				176    vs   181</p>
<p>The company reported its investments has risen to 16,554 billion lire, up 4.9 percent from the end-1995.</p>
<p>Group results</p>
<p>    Cons gross premium	 7,642    vs 7,119</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
